Package: PhysioNIRS
Title: Governed Near-Infrared Spectroscopy Data and SNIRF Input/Output
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Provides strict input, output, measurement identity, probe
    geometry, optical-density, modified Beer-Lambert, motion-correction, and
    short-separation nuisance, signal-quality, channel-pruning, and live
    neurofeedback contracts for continuous-wave functional near-infrared
    spectroscopy data stored in 'PhysioExperiment' objects.
    Shared Near Infrared Spectroscopy Format ('SNIRF') files are read and
    written through structured 'HDF5' APIs while preserving time bases,
    measurement order, probe coordinates, metadata tags, stimulus tables, and
    processing provenance.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2),
    PhysioCore
